{
    "title": "Applaydu Play & Discover",
    "description": "<h1>Unlock a new world of learning in Applaydu season 5</h1>\r\nApplaydu by Kinder is a safe learning world for your kids, filled with various themed islands to grow through playing. Your kids can learn about math and letters, and unleash their imagination by creating stories on the new LET\u2019S STORY! island. They can also learn about feelings and emotions with the new EMOTIVERSE island, help injured animals with veterinary games, and care for the planet in NATOONS.\r\nWatch your kids create stories with LET\u2019S STORY!, express feelings with EMOTIVERSE, explore diverse learning themes, and engage in AR experiences. Applaydu by Kinder is 100% kid-safe, ad-free, and ensures high-quality screen time under parents' supervision.\r\n\r\n<h1>Create kids own adventure in LET\u2019S STORY! Island</h1>\r\nApplaydu by Kinder welcomes LET\u2019S STORY!, a new island where your kids can create their own tales and engage in stories. In LET\u2019S STORY!, children can choose characters, destinations, and plots and create stories from images to audio. Parents and kids can listen to stories together and enjoy mini-games to inspire young minds.\r\n\r\n<h1>Develop emotion-learning with EMOTIVERSE Island</h1>\r\nTime for emotional intelligence with EMOTIVERSE in Applaydu by Kinder. Your kids can explore different emotions in EMOTIVERSE, and recognize and express their feelings. EMOTIVERSE also helps kids understand others\u2019 feelings through emotion-learning activities. Engaging in educational games while learning about emotions in EMOTIVERSE will make the feelings\u2019 journey enjoyable.\r\n\r\n<h1>Discover wild animals in NATOONS and learn how to care for them</h1>\r\nLet\u2019s welcome the baby animals to NATOONS! Children can explore wild animals, learn about how baby animals are born, how they sound and what their habitats are. Your kids can foster a connection with nature through activities like saving animals and picking up trash. Kids can step into the role of future vets, learning to heal animals. Let your children immerse themselves in the educational world of Applaydu NATOONS, where inspiring stories and learning games await!\r\n\r\n<h1>Unleash creativity with the Avatar House</h1>\r\nYour kids can create their dream house with avatar customization. They can express their feelings and unique style by decorating a custom bedroom with furniture, drawing floors and wallpaper. Tons of possible creations await in the Avatar House.\r\n\r\n<h1>Multiple learning games to grow skills</h1>\r\nStep into Applaydu by Kinder with inspiring educational games & stories. Various game types, from logic puzzles, racing, stories, AR activities, feelings & emotions exploration on EMOTIVERSE to animal petting, offer an immersive learning experience. Your kids can create with drawings, coloring, and playing with dinosaurs, or engage in educational games with math, numbers and letters.\r\n\r\n<h1>Teleport to a world of AR Joy and Movement!</h1>\r\nNow parents and kids enjoy AR JOY OF MOVING games! Backed by science, these fun-filled games keep kids active & learning through the proven JOY OF MOVING Methodology\u2014helping them grow, move, and thrive while having a blast at home! Your kids can also use the 3D scan to teleport their favorite characters to the Applaydu by Kinder AR world, to play and even talk to them.\r\n\r\n<h1>Monitor your child's learning progress</h1>\r\nApplaydu's parent area ensures a safe and educational environment for your kids. The feature allows you to monitor your children's progress with personalized recommendations. Applaydu by Kinder is 100% kid-safe, playable offline, ad-free, has no in-app purchases, and supports 18 languages.\r\n_________\r\nApplaydu, an Official Kinder App, is certified by the kidSAFE Seal Program (www.kidsafeseal.com) and EducationalAppStore.com.\r\nContact us at contact@applaydu.com\r\nFor privacy-related questions, please write to privacy@ferrero.com or go to http://applaydu.kinder.com/legal\r\nTo find instructions to delete your account, please visit:\r\nhttps://applaydu.kinder.com/static/public/docs/web/en/pp/pp-0.0.1.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h1>Unlock a new world of learning in Applaydu season 5</h1><br>Applaydu by Kinder is a safe learning world for your kids, filled with various themed islands to grow through playing. Your kids can learn about math and letters, and unleash their imagination by creating stories on the new LET\u2019S STORY! island. They can also learn about feelings and emotions with the new EMOTIVERSE island, help injured animals with veterinary games, and care for the planet in NATOONS.<br>Watch your kids create stories with LET\u2019S STORY!, express feelings with EMOTIVERSE, explore diverse learning themes, and engage in AR experiences. Applaydu by Kinder is 100% kid-safe, ad-free, and ensures high-quality screen time under parents&#39; supervision.<br><br><h1>Create kids own adventure in LET\u2019S STORY! Island</h1><br>Applaydu by Kinder welcomes LET\u2019S STORY!, a new island where your kids can create their own tales and engage in stories. In LET\u2019S STORY!, children can choose characters, destinations, and plots and create stories from images to audio. Parents and kids can listen to stories together and enjoy mini-games to inspire young minds.<br><br><h1>Develop emotion-learning with EMOTIVERSE Island</h1><br>Time for emotional intelligence with EMOTIVERSE in Applaydu by Kinder. Your kids can explore different emotions in EMOTIVERSE, and recognize and express their feelings. EMOTIVERSE also helps kids understand others\u2019 feelings through emotion-learning activities. Engaging in educational games while learning about emotions in EMOTIVERSE will make the feelings\u2019 journey enjoyable.<br><br><h1>Discover wild animals in NATOONS and learn how to care for them</h1><br>Let\u2019s welcome the baby animals to NATOONS! Children can explore wild animals, learn about how baby animals are born, how they sound and what their habitats are. Your kids can foster a connection with nature through activities like saving animals and picking up trash. Kids can step into the role of future vets, learning to heal animals. Let your children immerse themselves in the educational world of Applaydu NATOONS, where inspiring stories and learning games await!<br><br><h1>Unleash creativity with the Avatar House</h1><br>Your kids can create their dream house with avatar customization. They can express their feelings and unique style by decorating a custom bedroom with furniture, drawing floors and wallpaper. Tons of possible creations await in the Avatar House.<br><br><h1>Multiple learning games to grow skills</h1><br>Step into Applaydu by Kinder with inspiring educational games &amp; stories. Various game types, from logic puzzles, racing, stories, AR activities, feelings &amp; emotions exploration on EMOTIVERSE to animal petting, offer an immersive learning experience. Your kids can create with drawings, coloring, and playing with dinosaurs, or engage in educational games with math, numbers and letters.<br><br><h1>Teleport to a world of AR Joy and Movement!</h1><br>Now parents and kids enjoy AR JOY OF MOVING games! Backed by science, these fun-filled games keep kids active &amp; learning through the proven JOY OF MOVING Methodology\u2014helping them grow, move, and thrive while having a blast at home! Your kids can also use the 3D scan to teleport their favorite characters to the Applaydu by Kinder AR world, to play and even talk to them.<br><br><h1>Monitor your child&#39;s learning progress</h1><br>Applaydu&#39;s parent area ensures a safe and educational environment for your kids. The feature allows you to monitor your children&#39;s progress with personalized recommendations. Applaydu by Kinder is 100% kid-safe, playable offline, ad-free, has no in-app purchases, and supports 18 languages.<br>_________<br>Applaydu, an Official Kinder App, is certified by the kidSAFE Seal Program (www.kidsafeseal.com) and EducationalAppStore.com.<br>Contact us at contact@applaydu.com<br>For privacy-related questions, please write to privacy@ferrero.com or go to http://applaydu.kinder.com/legal<br>To find instructions to delete your account, please visit:<br>https://applaydu.kinder.com/static/public/docs/web/en/pp/pp-0.0.1.html",
